     "<div text=\"#000000\" bgcolor=\"#FFFFFF\"><blockquote type=\"cite\"><div><div class=\"gmail_quote\"><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0 0 0 .8ex;border-left:1px #ccc solid;padding-left:1ex\"><div text=\"#000000\" bgcolor=\"#FFFFFF\"><div><div><blockquote type=\"cite\"><div><div class=\"gmail_quote\"><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0 0 0 .8ex;border-left:1px #ccc solid;padding-left:1ex\">\r\n                          ID ďż˝ ďż˝osebek<br>\r\n                          1 ďż˝ ďż˝ ďż˝ ďż˝4_1<br>\r\n                          1 ďż˝ ďż˝ ďż˝ ďż˝4_1<br>\r\n                          2 ďż˝ ďż˝ ďż˝ ďż˝4_1<br>\r\n                          2 ďż˝ ďż˝ ďż˝ ďż˝4_1<br>\r\n                          3 ďż˝ ďż˝ ďż˝ ďż˝4_2<br>\r\n                          3 ďż˝ ďż˝ ďż˝ ďż˝4_2<br>\r\n                          3 ďż˝ ďż˝ ďż˝ ďż˝4_2<br>\r\n                          4 ďż˝ ďż˝ ďż˝ ďż˝4_2<br>\r\n                          4 ďż˝ ďż˝ ďż˝ ďż˝4_2<br>\r\n                          5 ďż˝ ďż˝ ďż˝ ďż˝4_2<br></blockquote></div></div></blockquote></div></div></div></blockquote></div></div></blockquote></div>"
    ],
    [
     2,
     "<div text=\"#000000\" bgcolor=\"#FFFFFF\"><blockquote type=\"cite\"><div><div class=\"gmail_quote\"><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0 0 0 .8ex;border-left:1px #ccc solid;padding-left:1ex\"><div text=\"#000000\" bgcolor=\"#FFFFFF\"><div><div><blockquote type=\"cite\"><div><div class=\"gmail_quote\"><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0 0 0 .8ex;border-left:1px #ccc solid;padding-left:1ex\">\r\n                          5 ďż˝ ďż˝ ďż˝ ďż˝4_2<br>\r\n                          <br>\r\n                          Katerih podvojitev bi se znebila? Obdrďż˝ala bi\r\n                          samo tiste zapise za posamezne osebke (4_1 in\r\n                          4_2), ki imajo najmanjďż˝o vrednost ID. Rezultat\r\n                          naj bi bil torej tak:<br>\r\n                          <br>\r\n                          ID ďż˝ ďż˝osebek<br>\r\n                          1 ďż˝ ďż˝ ďż˝ ďż˝4_1<br>\r\n                          1 ďż˝ ďż˝ ďż˝ ďż˝4_1<br>\r\n                          3 ďż˝ ďż˝ ďż˝ ďż˝4_2<br>\r\n                          3 ďż˝ ďż˝ ďż˝ ďż˝4_2<br>\r\n                          3 ďż˝ ďż˝ ďż˝ ďż˝4_2<br>\r\n                          <br>\r\n                          Naj povem ďż˝e to, da df ne morem agregirati,\r\n                          ker so v njem ďż˝e druge spremenljivke z\r\n                          nepodvojenimi vrednostmi.<br>\r\n                          <br>\r\n                          Upam, da je vpraďż˝anje razumljivo in se\r\n                          priporoďż˝am za reďż˝itev. :)<br>\r\n                          <br>\r\n                          Prijeten dan ďż˝elim vsem,<br>\r\n                          Urďż˝a</blockquote></div></div></blockquote></div></div></div></blockquote></div></div></blockquote></div>"
